<title>USA: Arco to carry 100 pct of Aug. Line 63 crude.</title>
<headline>Arco to carry 100 pct of Aug. Line 63 crude.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Richfield Co.'s Arco Pipeline Co said Monday it would carry 100 percent of crude oil nominated by shippers for August delivery on California's Line 63 pipeline.  </p>
<p>&quot;Arco's Line 63 will not be in proration,&quot; a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Shipments on the line, which runs from California's San Joaquin Valley to Los Angeles refineries, run between 105,000 and 110,000 barrels per day.</p>
</text>
